---
import { ExternalLink, Github, Mail, ShieldCheck } from "lucide-astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Trust and transparency — PerkCommons"
  description="Who operates PerkCommons, how the project is funded, how source research and human review differ, what submission data is collected, and how to report a problem."
>
  <section class="container py-14">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand">Trust and transparency</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-semibold">
      An open project with clear editorial accountability.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-muted">
      PerkCommons is an open-source project operated by Nataniel Bogacki, an individual
      based in Poland. This page explains who is responsible for the project,
      how it is funded, how records are researched and reviewed, and how to
      raise a concern.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <section class="rounded-md border border-line bg-surface p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Operator and funding</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">
          PerkCommons is currently operated by Nataniel Bogacki. The project is
          self-funded, and the only direct project expense paid so far has
          been the domain registration for perkcommons.com.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-md border border-line bg-surface p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">No pay-to-list model</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">
          Ordinary listings are not paid placements, sponsored placements, or
          affiliate links. Payment does not purchase factual approval,
          verification, ranking, or removal of another listing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-md border border-line bg-surface p-6">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold">
          <ShieldCheck size={20} aria-hidden="true" /> Research and human review
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">
          PerkCommons uses both automated source research and human moderation.
          Automated checks can collect provider evidence and suggest a current
          status, but they do not count as human review. A record is described
          as human-reviewed only after a moderator completes that review and
          the review provenance is recorded.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">
          A source check or human review is not a guarantee of eligibility,
          availability, safety, acceptance, or outcome. The program provider
          controls the final terms and may change them without notice.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm font-medium">
          <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2" href="/about/">
            Read the review methodology <ExternalLink size={16} aria-hidden="true" />
          </a>
          <a href="/data-quality/">See current data-quality metrics</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-md border border-line bg-surface p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Submission information</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">
          When someone submits an opportunity, PerkCommons may collect the
          information entered in the form, an optional email address, and
          approximate geolocation such as a country code. Technical request
          information may also be processed for moderation and abuse
          prevention. Submitter email addresses are not published.
        </p>
        <a class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-medium" href="/privacy/">
          Read the privacy notice <ExternalLink size={16} aria-hidden="true" />
        </a>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-14 border-t border-line pt-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Open-source repositories</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-muted">
        The current PerkCommons implementation and public dataset are
        maintained in the public PerkCommons GitHub repositories. Public history is preserved
        in Git so changes to code and published records can be inspected.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <a class="rounded-md border border-line bg-surface p-5 no-underline" href="https://github.com/PerkCommons/site" rel="noopener">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold"><Github size={18} aria-hidden="true" /> Site source</span>
          <span class="mt-2 block text-sm text-muted">Application, moderation runtime, migrations, and release history.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="rounded-md border border-line bg-surface p-5 no-underline" href="https://github.com/PerkCommons/data" rel="noopener">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold"><Github size={18} aria-hidden="true" /> Public data</span>
          <span class="mt-2 block text-sm text-muted">Version-controlled opportunity records, schemas, evidence metadata, and quality reports.</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-14 border-t border-line pt-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Report a problem</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-muted">
        To report inaccurate, expired, unsafe, or misleading information, open
        the relevant listing and select <strong>Report this listing</strong>.
        Reports are reviewed by moderators and do not remove records
        automatically. You can also contact the project by email.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-action px-5 py-3 font-medium text-white no-underline" href="/opportunities/">
          Browse listings
        </a>
        <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-line bg-surface px-5 py-3 font-medium no-underline" href="mailto:hello@perkcommons.com?subject=PerkCommons%20report">
          <Mail size={18} aria-hidden="true" /> Email PerkCommons
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>